                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A very cool concept that I quite enjoyed. \r\n\r\nIf you want to REALLY feel like you are controlling a complicated spacecraft, this is a great game for that. However if you want to do much other than a tutorial setting with your spacecraft, you will not find it. \r\nTo my knowledge the developer suffered a severe injury, and subsequently stopped development indefinitely.\r\nPerhaps someday that will change, but it seems very unlikely.\r\n\r\nSo if you feel like what is here right now is worth it? Pick it up, it's a very cool tech demo. If you wanted something deeper, keep on moving unfortunately.",
